        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose Your Hero</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select 1 of 4 heroes giving a bonus to different vehicles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >John Transport</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melissa Epic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sarah Sahara</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doug Ocean</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create networks of walking, biking, road and train paths.  Connect industries and cities together.  Bridge across the water.  Sail and fly.  Launch rockets that turn into money making satellites.  Remove cows with the Alien Transport ship.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Research</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Quantum Research building to increase your research point yield, money yield, transportation speed and total vehicle cap.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fish</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play natures game of luck for a quick and powerful buck as you roll the dice and hope to attain the rarest fishing loot.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Your Way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle the game alone or with a friend cooperating to progress at your own pace and conquer the world. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose Your Hero</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select 1 of 4 heroes giving a bonus to different vehicles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >John Transport</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melissa Epic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sarah Sahara</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doug Ocean</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create networks of walking, biking, road and train paths.  Connect industries and cities together.  Bridge across the water.  Sail and fly.  Launch rockets that turn into money making satellites.  Remove cows with the Alien Transport ship.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Research</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Quantum Research building to increase your research point yield, money yield, transportation speed and total vehicle cap.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fish</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play natures game of luck for a quick and powerful buck as you roll the dice and hope to attain the rarest fishing loot.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Your Way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle the game alone or with a friend cooperating to progress at your own pace and conquer the world. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>",
